WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.088
This six-step workflow is the foundation for the
module First state the

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:11.100
rule in plain language Second identify which fields
can be missing Third

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:15.400
group related Boolean tests with parentheses
especially when AND and OR appear

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:20.825
together Fourth when using CASE put specific or
high-priority branches before broad

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.388
branches because the first true branch wins Fifth
test edge cases such

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:31.062
as exact thresholds zero empty text whitespace FALSE
and NULL Finally

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:35.475
compare the output with the written rule This
workflow prevents a common

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.050
kind of SQL problem a statement that is
syntactically correct and runs

00:00:39.062 --> 00:00:42.488
without an error but quietly returns the wrong
cohort or label
